\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-8\">Professional Engineering for LG Cooling</h2>\n                <div class=\"space-y-6 text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-justify md:text-center mt-12\">\n                    <p>\n                        LG air conditioners are among the most technologically advanced machines on the market, featuring Dual Inverter compressors and high-logic PCB boards. However, even the best engineering requires expert maintenance to survive the intense dust and heat of Vadodara. Atlas Aircon provides a premium, <strong>independent LG AC service center Vadodara</strong> trusts for technical mastery over brand-authorized delays.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        From residential split units to industrial-grade <strong>Panel AC repair Vadodara</strong> for high-heat manufacturing environments, our local technicians are certified to handle complex electrical and refrigerant challenges. Whether you&#8217;re in Alkapuri needing an <strong>emergency LG AC repair</strong> or in Makarpura GIDC requiring urgent maintenance for a CNC electrical panel cooling unit, we bring the field experience necessary to restore operations safely.\n                    </p>\n                    <p>\n                        We operate with absolute transparency. Many people worry about getting overcharged for repairs they don’t actually need. We do things differently. We provide a complete <strong>LG AC repair charges Vadodara</strong> breakdown before any work begins. We explain the technical fault in plain English and give you a fixed quote. No surprises, no hidden fees. Just good, honest service.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Our Engineering Portfolio</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">From domestic Dual Inverter repairs to critical industrial panel cooling, we provide total climate control.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10\">\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#1A202C]/20 group-hover:bg-transparent transition-colors z-10\"></div>\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repairing-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"General LG AC Repair Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-tools\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">General AC Troubleshooting</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">If your LG AC is leaking, not cooling, or refusing to start, we deploy high-precision diagnostics. We specialize in <strong>LG split AC repair Vadodara</strong>, ensuring that every relay, sensor, and motor is brought back to peak efficiency.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹399</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden\">\n                            <img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Safe LG AC Installation Vadodara\" onerror=\"handleImageError(this)\" title=\"\">\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-level-up-alt\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Installation Mastery</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Precision mounting is key to machine life. Our <strong>LG AC installation Vadodara</strong> team focuses on perfect leveling, high-grade flaring to prevent gas leaks, and deep vacuuming to ensure your unit delivers maximum BTUs.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹700</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n\n                    <article class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-100 shadow-lg group transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2.5 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]\">\n                        <div class=\"relative h-56 overflow-hidden bg-[#1A202C] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <i class=\"fas fa-industry text-6xl text-[#D4AF37] opacity-80 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700\"></i>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-8 flex flex-col h-[calc(100%-14rem)]\">\n                            <div class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 w-14 h-14 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] text-2xl mb-6 shadow-sm\"><i class=\"fas fa-server\"></i></div>\n                            <h3 class=\"text-xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-3 mt-0\">Industrial Panel AC Repair</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6 line-clamp-3 text-sm\">Sensitive industrial machinery panels produce massive heat. If your <strong>LG panel AC</strong> fails, your entire CNC or electrical panel is at risk. Our engineers provide rapid on-site service in GIDC areas to prevent machinery burnout.</p>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-t border-gray-100 pt-4 mt-auto\">\n                                <span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#D4AF37]\">From ₹1500</span>\n                                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#1A202C] font-semibold hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition-colors flex items-center no-underline\">Call Now <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt ml-2 text-sm\"></i></a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"guide\" class=\"py-16 bg-white relative overflow-hidden\">\n            <div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-1/3 h-full bg-yellow-50/50 skew-x-12 transform origin-top-right z-0\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 max-w-6xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Expert Tips for Your LG AC</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Understanding the basics of HVAC thermodynamics can help you prevent 80% of common breakdowns.</p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"space-y-12 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg text-justify md:text-left\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-leaf text-green-500 mr-3\"></i> 1. Filter Cleanliness is Vital</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            You&#8217;d be shocked how many &#8220;no cooling&#8221; calls are solved simply by washing the filters. When customers ask, &#8220;<strong>why is my LG AC not cooling?</strong>&#8220;, dust is usually the culprit. Your machine pulls air from the room to remove heat. If a blanket of dust is blocking that air, the machine &#8220;suffocates,&#8221; and the compressor has to work at double capacity.\n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            A bi-weekly <strong>LG AC filter cleaning</strong> is something you can easily do at home. Just rinse the mesh under a tap, dry them, and slide them back. This small habit can prevent the indoor unit from freezing over and save your electricity bill from skyrocketing.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-bold text-[#1A202C] mb-4 flex items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt text-red-500 mr-3\"></i> 2. Defending Your PCB from Power Spikes</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mb-4\">\n                            LG inverter units are incredibly efficient, but their logic boards are sensitive to power fluctuations. A sudden spike in the Vadodara grid can instantly fry a logic component. \n                        </p>\n                        <p>\n                            While a good stabilizer helps, it&#8217;s not foolproof. If your unit goes dead after a power cut, don&#8217;t assumption the motherboard is ruined. Our experts in <strong>LG inverter AC PCB repair Vadodara</strong> can often fix specific burnt points on the board, keeping your original hardware active and saving you from a massive replacement bill.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-3xl my-12\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-6xl py-12\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-white\">LG Error Code Glossary</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">Is your LG display flashing letters? Here is a technical breakdown of common <strong>LG AC error codes</strong> to help you understand the fault.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-700\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n                        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse m-0 text-sm md:text-base\">\n                            <thead>\n                                <tr class=\"bg-gray-950 text-gray-300 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/6\">Code</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/3\">Technical Fault</th>\n                                    <th class=\"p-6 font-semibold w-1/2\">Required Action</th>\n                                </tr>\n                            </thead>\n                            <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-700 text-base\">\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CH 05</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Communication Error</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The indoor unit brain cannot talk to the outdoor unit. This is often a wiring fault or a blown board component. Requires an electrical tracing.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors bg-gray-800/30\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CH 21</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">DC Peak Fault</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The IPM (Inverter Power Module) has detected an over-current spike. This is usually a PCB issue or a failing compressor. Power off immediately.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                                <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-700/50 transition-colors\">\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-black text-[#D4AF37] text-xl\">CH 38</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 font-medium text-gray-300\">Gas Leak Detection</td>\n                                    <td class=\"p-6 text-gray-400\">The machine senses a drop in pressure. Turn it off to protect the compressor from burnout and call us for proper leak detection and <strong>LG AC gas filling</strong>.</td>\n                                </tr>\n                            </tbody>\n                        </table>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-5xl\">\n                <div class=\"text-center mb-16\">\n                    <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-[#1A202C] relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6\">Standardized Service Tariff</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-4\">We believe in transparent, upfront talk about money. Below is our typical price list for <strong>LG AC service in Vadodara</strong>.</p>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-1 md:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-sm\">\n                    <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm m-0\">\n                        <thead>\n                            <tr class=\"bg-[#D4AF37]/10 text-[#1A202C]\">\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 text-lg\">Service Area</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 hidden md:table-cell text-lg\">Scope</th>\n                                <th class=\"p-5 font-bold border-b border-[#D4AF37]/20 text-right text-lg\">Investment (INR)</th>\n                            </tr>\n                        </thead>\n                        <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-gray-100 text-gray-700 text-base\">\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Standard wet service</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">Filter wash, drain check, and system scan</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap\">₹399 &#8211; ₹599</td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Deep Jet Machine Cleaning</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">High-pressure wash of internal grilles and rotor fan</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap\">₹999</td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">PCB Motherboard Repair</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">Component fixing on complex logic boards</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap\">From ₹1500</td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr class=\"hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\">\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-semibold\">Gas Recharging (Full)</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 text-gray-500 hidden md:table-cell\">Includes finding the leak and refilling R32/R410A gas</td>\n                                <td class=\"p-5 font-bold text-[#D4AF37] text-right whitespace-nowrap\">₹2500 &#8211; ₹4500</td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody>\n                    </table>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4 text-center\">*Baseline estimates only. Final <strong>LG AC repair cost Vadodara</strong> provided after physical machine inspection.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <section class=\"py-16 bg-[#1A202C] text-white relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl my-12 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10\" style=\"background-image: radial-gradient(#D4AF37 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 30px 30px;\"></div>\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 py-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"font-['Poppins',sans-serif] font-extrabold text-white relative inline-block after:content-[''] after:absolute after:-bottom-2.5 after:left-1/2 after:-translate-x-1/2 after:w-[60px] after:h-1 after:bg-[#D4AF37] after:rounded-sm text-3xl md:text-5xl mb-6 text-whit