                       <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-4\">\n                            <strong>We want to be clear that Atlas Aircon is an independent, third-party repair business.</strong> We are not official representatives of, authorized by, or sponsored by the LG brand. When we use the name &#8220;LG&#8221; on our site, it is strictly to inform you that our local engineers are fully trained and experienced in servicing that specific brand of air conditioners.\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm mb-0\">\n                            We support your right to choose who maintains your appliances. Independent repair shops often provide faster response times and better component-level fixing than brand-exclusive centers. To give you total peace of mind, we provide our own 3 to 6-month warranty on any repair work we perform.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <footer class=\"bg-[#1A202C] text-gray-400 py-12 rounded-3xl mt-12 border-t-4 border-[#D4AF37]\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\">\n            <h3 class=\"text-white font-black text-2xl m-0 tracking-tight uppercase\">Atlas<span class=\"text-[#D4AF37]\">Aircon</span></h3>\n            <p class=\"text-sm mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto\">The authority in independent air conditioning repairs across Vadodara. Engineering mastery, transparent pricing, and 24/7 reliability.</p>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-center space-x-6 mt-8\">\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"text-[#D4AF37] hover:text-white transition-colors text-lg font-bold no-underline flex items-center\">\n                    <i class=\"fas fa-phone-alt mr-2\"></i> +91 97272 57141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-xs mt-8\">&copy; 2026 Atlas Aircon Engineering. All Rights Reserved. 